Zoom Funktion für TextEditor
----------------------------


1. sudo apt-get install -y gedit-plugin-text-size
2. TextEditor -> Edit → Preferences → Plugins -> Text-Size[x] aktivieren

->  you can tick the Text Size box and zoom in with ctrl & +.

